{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C1\", \"C3\", \"C2\", \"C4\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C3\", \"C2\", \"C4\"],\n  \"why\": \"keep：清单明确标为“无”，因此四个候选都没有必须保留的指定实质内容，排序仅沿用候选顺序。cover：C1和C3最完整地接住了熟悉的柔软重新出现、短暂松弛、欢喜以及不舍；C2有喘息感和不愿压下去的意思，但少了当下的欢喜；C4则没有充分写出对它退去的不舍。lean：C2的“认得—不再审问—喘过一口气”推进最紧凑；C1和C3多写了几层感受，但仍然顺畅；C4对安宁的认出和记忆略有重复。plain：C1和C3最像一个人在讲自己的心情，具体直接；C2的反问很有人味，但稍带修辞；C4的“记得……便愿意”更像解释性的叙述。overall：C2胜在把过去真实得到的满足转化成此刻不再自我审问的理由，最符合Thread提供心理因果的任务；C1和C3的情绪过程更完整自然，但对为什么愿意暂时放下追问交代较少；C4虽然补足了因果，却有重复，且对不舍的表达不足。C1与C3完全相同，二者排名没有实质差别。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "67fc116f-02e2-4753-a4cc-5e5b1c44c93f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T012740154863Z", "elapsed_seconds": 48.25, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T01:28:28.411562+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b92101608e2ac5ec9e2f8c63fef958019e45b4fc21b2859069918b7c58649606", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\